<title>USA: Video Lottery not seeking Tote unit sale.</title>
<headline>Video Lottery not seeking Tote unit sale.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Video Lottery Technologies Inc said it has rejuvenated its United Tote unit and is no longer seeking to sell the unit.</p>
<p>The supplier of system software, equipment, and related services for on-line lotteries said it had attracted several potential acquirers, but is not eager to be acquired.</p>
<p>It said it will listen to all offers, but not risk its future on a proposed deal whose structure is not disclosed or whose financing is very much in doubt.</p>
</text>
